OL,3,GNEWSACeramics firm takes 'giant leap'
OL,4,Atowards building on the Moon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company says it has turned Moon dust
OL,7,Finto "solid pellets", which could pave
OL,8,Fthe way to produce bricks on the Moon's
OL,9,Fsurface.
OL,11,FScientific consultancy firm Lucideon,
OL,12,Fbased in Staffordshire, said the
OL,13,Fprocess involved firing electricity
OL,14,Fdirectly at the dust, which solidified
OL,15,Fit.
OL,17,FThe innovation would help to "lay the
OL,18,Ffoundations for humanity's next giant
OL,19,Fleap," said the company.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
